00:16:38.920 --> 00:16:44.220
And like, I think there had been one driving scene with, um, Michael Scott before that on, for Scott's Tots.
而且，我想在那之前，我和迈克尔·斯科特在《斯科特的托特》那一集里应该有一场开车戏。

309
00:16:44.380 --> 00:16:49.140
And that was, I think that was the other time I had been driving with him, but yeah, they're such a funny pair.
那是我记得和他一起开车的另一次经历，但没错，他们真是非常滑稽的一对。

310
00:16:49.500 --> 00:16:51.320
It's fun to see those two characters together.
看到这两个角色在一起很有趣。

311
00:16:51.320 --> 00:17:01.280
There were a few moments where Steve is Michael just as exasperated on how to connect with Aaron and it's, it's like so painful for him.
有几个瞬间，史蒂夫饰演的迈克尔对如何与亚伦建立联系感到非常恼火，这对他来说太痛苦了。

312
00:17:01.440 --> 00:17:03.880
