看他演那些戏真是太搞笑了。

313
00:17:04.020 --> 00:17:05.760
Cause we don't really see Michael like that.
因为我们平时看不到那样的迈克尔。

314
00:17:05.760 --> 00:17:09.720
Michael just constantly wants everyone else's attention and approval.
迈克尔总是渴望得到别人的关注和认可。

315
00:17:09.960 --> 00:17:13.780
So to see him not wanting someone's attention is really funny.
所以看到他不想引起某人的注意，真的很有趣。

316
00:17:14.240 --> 00:17:16.760
It's so, it's like, I was seeing the exact same thing.
真是，我当时看到的也是同样的情况。

