Um, more of a comment Reagan H from Boston, Massachusetts wrote in to say shout out to Ellie Kemper for this episode,
嗯，更像是一条评论。来自马萨诸塞州波士顿的里根·H写信来说，要给这一集的艾莉·坎伯点个赞，

326
00:17:43.460 --> 00:17:49.420
because every single line that she delivers in the restaurant scene is Emmy worthy, Emmy worthy.
因为她在餐厅戏里说的每一句台词都值得拿艾美奖，绝对值得。

