336
00:18:09.660 --> 00:18:10.900
I think you should sell this.
你应该把这个卖掉。

337
00:18:11.160 --> 00:18:14.180
It's going to be something that projects up there and they're just holograms coming.
它会是一种投影设备，就像全息影像一样出现。

338
00:18:14.280 --> 00:18:15.180
I'm doing, I'm working on it.
我正在做，我正在研究它。

