00:18:17.360 --> 00:18:26.820
Those lines were written by Mindy and it's easy to deliver lines that, as we all know, that are written so brilliantly.
那些台词是敏迪写的，正如我们所知，写得如此精彩的台词，演起来很容易。

342
00:18:26.820 --> 00:18:33.100
And, um, they, they were just like, I think there were a couple of times when Steve was like, okay.
而且，嗯，它们，它们就像是，我想有几次史蒂夫说，好吧。

343
00:18:33.200 --> 00:18:36.580
And then, you know, cause we all know there was room for improv.
然后，你知道，因为我们都知道还有即兴发挥的空间。

344
00:18:36.840 --> 00:18:45.340
I found that to be so scary, like doing a run or whatever, because I think there's so much pressure on, and there were, uh, there were a few,
我觉得那很可怕，比如做即兴表演之类的，因为我觉得压力太大了，而且当时有，呃，有几次，

