00:19:20.060 --> 00:19:22.420
Like his eyes are completely covered.
就像他的眼睛完全被遮住了一样。

352
00:19:22.920 --> 00:19:23.960
Terrific aim.
瞄得真准。

353
00:19:24.600 --> 00:19:25.220
Thank you.
谢谢。

354
00:19:25.640 --> 00:19:26.300
Thank you.
谢谢。

