它真的……噢，它真的让我为你的角色感到心碎。

360
00:19:50.520 --> 00:19:51.680
I love that scene.
我很喜欢那场戏。

361
00:19:51.980 --> 00:19:52.120
Yeah.
是啊。

362
00:19:52.260 --> 00:19:54.020
Well, thank you for saying that.
好吧，谢谢你这么说。

363
00:19:54.020 --> 00:20:06.480
I, I remember, I, I do have vivid memories of that day and episode because it is the first time Aaron really has an emotional, um, moments and a full on, like you said, breakdown.
我记得，我确实对那天和那一集有很深刻的记忆，因为那是亚伦第一次真正有了情感上的……嗯，时刻，正如你所说，彻底的崩溃。

364
00:20:06.680 --> 00:20:18.220
And I was very nervous about that because not only from an acting point of view, which was just, okay, you need to find these feelings in there and need to dig deep on this day.
我当时对此非常紧张，因为不仅是从表演的角度来看，这只是，好吧，你需要找到内心的这些感受，并且在那一天深入挖掘。

365
00:20:18.220 --> 00:20:22.860
But also I was really intimidated, um, to do it in front of all of you guys.
而且在你们所有人面前做这件事，我也感到非常胆怯。

366
00:20:23.020 --> 00:20:31.980
