394
00:22:02.280 --> 00:22:06.040
And our dialogue was so ridiculous, but the sentiment was so real.
我们的台词太荒谬了，但那种情感却如此真实。

395
00:22:06.360 --> 00:22:07.560
That's exactly right.
完全正确。

